            "review_title": "Review at Giang Lam Ky - Mi Chu Cau",
            "review_text": "Kang Chuen K\n4 contributions\n1\nA story of ethic Chinese family\nAug 2017 • Family\n唐人三代經營。一部麵車，在西貢街市屹立七十多個年頭。既見證了當地的治亂興衰，也是一家人的血汗淚水。\n\n湯底是自家每天用豬骨、牛骨煲十幾小時而成的。麵用高筋麵粉打成，很飽肚。魚肉新鮮，鮮甜。\n\n不知道還有多少食客能讀中文字，但店名，菜譜上還是放上中文；鏡畫上的還有中國曲目故事。\n\nRunning by the same ethic Chinese family over 70 years in Saigon market, this noodle cart witnesses the history of this city and the family.\n\nThe broth is home made daily by pork and cow bones. Noodle is made of hi-protein flour. Fish meat is very fresh.\n\nThe customers probably cannot understand Chinese language, but its menu keeps the Chinese characters and the mirror paints are old Chinese stories.\nRead more\nWritten August 30, 2017",
            "rating": 5.0,
            "review_date": "2026-10-14",
            "travel_date": "Recent",
            "feature_depth_status": "Schema-Full-Features-Validated"
        },
