            "review_title": "Review at Giang Lam Ky - Mi Chu Cau",
            "review_text": "Foodiesyd\nSydney, Australia7 contributions\n0\nDelicious and authentic noodle bowls\nNov 2016\nHoliday in Vietnam . Hunting for the best noodle in town and stumbled upon this greatest gem. So delicious. So authentic and super casual ! I highly recommended this little stall for its authenticity in flavours and service !\nWritten November 24, 2016",
